blurb = "Depicts two porters in straw capes carrying loads on their back as they make their way through ankle-deep mud on a mountain path. It is raining, but the porters seem to be in good humor despite the rain and mud. One of them carries what looks like a wrapped banner. Behind them are the people whose belongings the men may be carrying."
